foldkit-flow depends on, and takes its design from, xyflow:

  @xyflow/system, https://github.com/xyflow/xyflow/tree/main/packages/system
  Copyright (c) 2019-2025 webkid GmbH. MIT licence.

React Flow and Svelte Flow are bindings over @xyflow/system. foldkit-flow is a third
binding: it drives the framework-free controllers of that package (pan and zoom, drag,
handles, minimap, resizer) from Foldkit Mounts and uses its edge-path and graph
utilities. xyflow asks its users to keep the attribution link or to support the project;
foldkit-flow therefore shows a link to https://xyflow.com in the corner of the canvas
by default, and an application can turn it off (see README.md, "Credit").

Other third-party code in this repository keeps its own licence next to it; see
PROVENANCE.md.
